  aciklama:
  - "Fal\u0131n\u0131n hen\xFCz yorumlamad\u0131\u011F\u0131m son detaylar\u0131nda
    cam bir kadeh var. Kadehin dibine sinmekten vazge\xE7emeyen o son yudumu ise
    net bir \u015Fekilde g\xF6rebiliyorum. Bug\xFCnlerde kendini sorguluyor ve s\u0131k\xE7a
    ge\xE7mi\u015Fe mi d\xF6n\xFCyorsun {{isim}}? Belli ki ya\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    ve eksik kald\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCn g\xFCzel
    g\xFCnlerin tad\u0131 dama\u011F\u0131nda, hat\u0131ralar\u0131 akl\u0131nda,
    hissettirdikleri ise y\xFCre\u011Finde kalm\u0131\u015F. Bilhassa ayr\u0131l\u0131k
    sonras\u0131, eski mutlu zamanlar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 daha s\u0131k an\u0131msad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    hissediyorum. Peki ya bunlar\u0131n tekrarlar\u0131n\u0131n, daha da g\xFCzel
    bi\xE7imlerde ya\u015Fanmayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 sana kim s\xF6yledi? Telvelerin,
    ya\u015Fanaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6yl\xFCyor..."
